    "pve": {
      "en": "Elite Binding Ritual. Create a level 1...10...12 spirit. Whenever this spirit's attack hits a stationary foe, that foe is knocked down and the spirit loses 70...54...50 Health. This spirit dies after 30...54...60 seconds.",
